{'symbol': 'WTW', 'date': '2023-04-18 04:02:00', 'title': "POLITICAL RISK LOSS FREQUENCY SURGES IN 2022 TO BECOME “EVERYONE'S RISK” AS UKRAINE WAR DELIVERS WIDESPREAD FINANCIAL LOSSES", 'text': "LONDON, APRIL 18, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NINE OUT OF TEN COMPANIES HAVE SUFFERED A POLITICAL RISK LOSS IN THE PAST YEAR, TRANSFORMING POLITICAL RISK FROM A LOW FREQUENCY, HIGH SEVERITY PERIL INTO “EVERYONE'S RISK,” ACCORDING TO HOW ARE GLOBAL BUSINESSES MANAGING TODAY'S POLITICAL RISKS A NEW REPORT BY WTW (NASDAQ: WTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING, AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY."}{'symbol': 'WTW', 'date': '2023-04-18 04:00:00', 'title': 'WTW APPOINTS MY THIEN NGUYEN AS COUNTRY LEADER AND HEAD OF CORPORATE RISK & BROKING IN VIETNAM', 'text': 'SINGAPORE, APRIL 18, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WTW (NASDAQ: WTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF MY THIEN NGUYEN AS COUNTRY LEADER AND HEAD OF CORPORATE RISK & BROKING FOR VIETNAM, EFFECTIVE 1 AUGUST 2023. THIEN SUCCEEDS PHILIPPE ROBINEAU WHO WILL LEAVE WTW ON 31 JULY.'}